#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Two-node staged PROXY protocol cutover; fixed RU route only, no TLS on Beget.

stage-hetzner keeps the current 18443 route alive. switch-beget moves only new
connections to 18444 with a PROXY preamble. Roll back Beget FIRST, then Hetzner.
No API process, primary vhost, DB, financial flag or certificate is changed.
"""
